function addAlert(t,done){modal(`<h3>${I('bell')}${L('新增价格提醒','New price alert')}</h3><div class="fr"><label>${L('代币','Token')}</label><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">${avP(t)}<b>${esc(t.s)}</b><span class="t3">${L('现在','now')} ${fU(t.mc)}</span></div></div><div class="fr"><label>${L('条件','Condition')}</label><select class="inp" id="ak"><option value="ge">${L('市值 ≥','MC ≥')}</option><option value="le">${L('市值 ≤','MC ≤')}</option></select></div><div class="fr"><label>${L('市值（美元）','MC (USD)')}</label><input class="inp" id="av" inputmode="decimal" value="" placeholder="${L('自己填','yours')}"></div><div class="fr"><label>${L('送到','Send to')}</label><span class="t2">${L('这台电脑的桌面通知（雷达开着时）','Desktop notification on this computer (while the radar is open)')}</span></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn s" data-x>${L('取消','Cancel')}</button><button class="btn p" id="aok">${L('新增','Add')}</button></div>`,(m,cl)=>{$('#aok',m).onclick=()=>{const v=parseFloat($('#av',m).value);if(!(v>0)){toast(L('请填市值','Enter a market cap'));return}ALERTS.unshift({tk:t.id,sym:t.s,k:$('#ak',m).value,v,on:1});LS.s('alerts2',ALERTS);cl();toast(L('已新增提醒','Alert added'));done&&done();redrawType('alerts')}})}

/* ===== 工作区：栏＋面板，拖拉、调大小、放大、关闭、切换种类 ===== */
const PRESETS={
 overview:{zh:'总览',en:'Overview',cols:[{w:UI_40,ps:[{t:'rank',h:1,o:{all:1}}]},{w:UI_20,ps:[{t:'meta',h:FR_0P42,o:{allc:1}},{t:'signals',h:FR_0P58,o:{allc:1}}]},{w:UI_20,ps:[{t:'kolfeed',h:FR_0P55,o:{allc:1}},{t:'calls',h:FR_0P45,o:{allc:1}}]},{w:UI_20,ps:[{t:'newmini',h:FR_0P55},{t:'traders',h:FR_0P45}]}]},
 snipe:{zh:'打新',en:'Sniping',cols:[{w:UI_72,ps:[{t:'trench',h:1}]},{w:UI_28,ps:[{t:'calls',h:FR_0P5},{t:'kolfeed',h:FR_0P5}]}]},
 watch:{zh:'盯盘',en:'Monitor',cols:[{w:UI_26,ps:[{t:'rank',h:1,o:{link:1,tab:'hot',per:'h1',nometa:1}}]},{w:UI_48,ps:[{t:'kline',h:FR_0P62},{t:'trades',h:FR_0P38}]},{w:UI_26,ps:[{t:'holders',h:FR_0P52},{t:'ai',h:FR_0P48}]}]}
};
const PMIN=300;let PID=1;const newId=()=>'p'+(PID++)+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,CNT_5);
function fromPreset(k){const P=PRESETS[k]||ST.custom.find(x=>x.k===k);let C=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(P.cols));
 /* 面板最小宽度：一般 300px、排行／新币三栏 440px；放不下就把最后一栏收进前一栏的分页，再把宽度从宽的栏匀给窄的栏 */
 if(innerWidth>PX_760){const wide=c=>c.ps.some(p=>p.t==='rank'||p.t==='trench'||p.t==='kline');const mn=c=>wide(c)?440:PMIN;const avail=()=>innerWidth-72-6*(C.length-1)-12;
  const W0=C.map(c=>c.w);let nf=0;while(C.length>CNT_2&&C.reduce((a,c)=>a+mn(c),0)>avail()){const r=C.pop();C[C.length-1].ps.push(...r.ps);if(!nf++)C[C.length-1].w+=r.w*.6;else C[C.length-1].w=W0[C.length-1]}
  const A=avail(),tw=C.reduce((a,c)=>a+c.w,0);let px=C.map(c=>c.w/tw*A);for(let it=0;it<PX_4;it++){let need=0;px=px.map((v,i)=>{const m=mn(C[i]);if(v<m){need+=m-v;return m}return v});if(need<=0)break;const sl=px.map((v,i)=>Math.max(0,v-mn(C[i])));const st=sl.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);if(st<=0)break;px=px.map((v,i)=>v-need*sl[i]/st)}
  C.forEach((c,i)=>c.w=px[i]/A*100)}
 return {preset:k,cols:C.map(c=>({w:c.w,ps:c.ps.map(p=>({id:newId(),t:p.t,h:p.h,o:Object.assign(PT[p.t].def(),p.o||{})}))}))}}
ST.custom=LS.g('custom',[]);ST.lay=LS.g('lay4',null);if(!ST.lay||!ST.lay.cols||!ST.lay.cols.length)ST.lay=fromPreset('overview');
for(const c of ST.lay.cols)for(const p of c.ps){if(!PT[p.t])p.t='rank';p.o=Object.assign(PT[p.t].def(),p.o||{})}
let saveT=0;function saveLayout(){clearTimeout(saveT);saveT=setTimeout(()=>LS.s('lay4',ST.lay),200)}
const INST=new Map();/* 面板 id → {el, body, h（元件）} */
function panelEl(p){let x=INST.get(p.id);if(x)return x;const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='pnl';el.dataset.id=p.id;el.innerHTML=`<div class="ph"></div><div class="pb"></div>`;x={el,p,h:null};INST.set(p.id,x);paintHead(x);mountBody(x);return x}
function paintHead(x){const p=x.p,T=PT[p.t];const wid=T.widget?focusTok():null;x.el.querySelector('.ph').innerHTML=`<span class="grip">${I('grip')}</span><button class="tt" data-menu data-a="type"><span class="ic">${I(T.ic)}</span>${L(T.zh,T.en)}${I('chev','s12')}</button>${wid?`<button class="tokchip" data-menu data-a="pick">${av(wid,'sm')}${esc(wid.s)}${I('chev','s12')}</button>`:''}<div class="acts">${T.link?`<button class="hb${p.o.link?' on':''}" data-a="link" title="${L('联动：点币只切换 K 线／成交／持有人小组件，不跳页','Link: clicking a token updates the chart widgets instead of opening a page')}">${I('link')}</button>`:''}<button class="hb mx" data-a="max" title="${L('放大／还原（Esc）','Maximize / restore (Esc)')}">${I(x.el.classList.contains('max')?'min':'max')}</button><button class="hb" data-a="close" title="${L('关闭','Close')}">${I('close')}</button></div>`}
function mountBody(x){x.el.classList.remove('stale');const b=x.el.querySelector('.pb');if(x.h&&x.h.dispose)x.h.dispose();if(x.h&&x.h.destroy)x.h.destroy();b.innerHTML='';if(ST.err&&!['alerts','pos','watch'].includes(x.p.t)){b.innerHTML=`<div class="est err"><div class="eic">${I('radio')}</div><b>${L('资料源连不上','Data source unreachable')}</b><p>${L('这条链的看盘资料读不到。画面保留最后一次的资料；自动买卖照「读不到资料＝不买」处理。','Relay has not answered for 30s. Auto-trading treats missing data as no-buy.')}</p><div class="eac"><button class="btn s" data-retry>${L('重试','Retry')}</button><button class="btn s" data-health>${L('看资料健康','Data health')}</button></div></div>`;b.querySelector('[data-retry]').onclick=()=>{b.innerHTML=skel();setTimeout(()=>mountBody(x),700)};b.querySelector('[data-health]').onclick=()=>{ST.setJump='s-data';openPage('set')};x.h={};return}x.h=PT[x.p.t].mount(b,x.p)||{}}
function skel(n=UI_8){return `<div class="skel">${Array.from({length:n},(_,i)=>`<div class="sk"><i class="a"></i><i style="width:${40+(i*37)%45}%"></i><i class="r"></i></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function renderWS(){const ws=$('#ws');const keep=new Set();const frag=document.createDocumentFragment();const cols=ST.lay.cols;
 const tabs=document.createElement('div');tabs.className='mtabs';frag.appendChild(tabs);
 cols.forEach((c,ci)=>{if(ci){const v=document.createElement('div');v.className='vs';v.dataset.ci=ci;frag.appendChild(v)}const ce=document.createElement('div');ce.className='wcol';ce.style.flexGrow=c.w;ce.dataset.ci=ci;
  /* 窄视窗（761–1199）：一栏最多两个面板，其余收进分页 */const tabbed=innerWidth>PX_760&&c.ps.length>CNT_2&&(innerWidth<PX_1600||c.ps.length>CNT_3);const rest=tabbed?c.ps.slice(1):[];if(tabbed&&!rest.some(p=>p.id===c.act))c.act=rest[0].id;
  c.ps.forEach((p,pi)=>{const x=panelEl(p);x.p=p;keep.add(p.id);if(tabbed&&pi>0){if(pi===1){const h=document.createElement('div');h.className='hs';h.dataset.ci=ci;h.dataset.pi=1;ce.appendChild(h);const tb=document.createElement('div');tb.className='ctabs';tb.innerHTML=rest.map(q=>`<button class="tab${q.id===c.act?' on':''}" data-ctab="${q.id}" data-ci="${ci}">${I(PT[q.t].ic,'s12')}${L(PT[q.t].zh,PT[q.t].en)}</button>`).join('');ce.appendChild(tb)}x.el.style.display=p.id===c.act?'':'none';x.el.style.flexGrow=rest.reduce((a,q)=>a+q.h,0);ce.appendChild(x.el);return}
   x.el.style.display='';if(pi){const h=document.createElement('div');h.className='hs';h.dataset.ci=ci;h.dataset.pi=pi;ce.appendChild(h)}/* 分页栏：第一个面板至少拿一半多一点，免得 1024／1280 只剩一两行 */x.el.style.flexGrow=tabbed&&pi===0?Math.max(p.h,rest.reduce((a,q)=>a+q.h,0)*1.3):p.h;ce.appendChild(x.el)});frag.appendChild(ce)});
 for(const [id,x] of INST)if(!keep.has(id)){if(x.h&&x.h.dispose)x.h.dispose();if(x.h&&x.h.destroy)x.h.destroy();INST.delete(id);x.el.remove()}
 const drop=$('.drop',ws),guide=$('.guide',ws);ws.innerHTML='';ws.appendChild(frag);ws.appendChild(drop);ws.appendChild(guide);paintMTabs();$$('.wpre button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('on',b.dataset.pre===ST.lay.preset));saveLayout()}
function allPanels(){return ST.lay.cols.flatMap(c=>c.ps)}
let MON=null;function paintMTabs(){const t=$('#ws .mtabs');if(!t)return;const ps=allPanels();if(!ps.find(p=>p.id===MON))MON=ps[0]?.id;t.innerHTML=ps.map(p=>`<button class="tab${p.id===MON?' on':''}" data-mp="${p.id}">${I(PT[p.t].ic,'s12')}${L(PT[p.t].zh,PT[p.t].en)}</button>`).join('')+`<button class="tab" data-a="addp">${I('plus','s12')}</button>`;for(const [id,x] of INST)x.el.classList.toggle('mon',id===MON)}
function findP(id){for(let ci=0;ci<ST.lay.cols.length;ci++){const pi=ST.lay.cols[ci].ps.findIndex(p=>p.id===id);if(pi>=0)return [ci,pi]}return null}
function normCols(){ST.lay.cols=ST.lay.cols.filter(c=>c.ps.length);const tw=ST.lay.cols.reduce((s,c)=>s+c.w,0)||1;ST.lay.cols.forEach(c=>{c.w=c.w/tw*100;const th=c.ps.reduce((s,p)=>s+p.h,0)||1;c.ps.forEach(p=>p.h=p.h/th)})}
function closePanel(id){const f=findP(id);if(!f)return;const snap=JSON.stringify(ST.lay);const [ci,pi]=f;const P=ST.lay.cols[ci].ps[pi];ST.lay.cols[ci].ps.splice(pi,1);normCols();ST.lay.preset='';renderWS();
 toast(L(`已关闭「${PT[P.t].zh}」`,`Closed "${PT[P.t].en}"`),[L('复原','Undo'),()=>{ST.lay=JSON.parse(snap);renderWS()}])}
function addPanel(t,o){const ws=ST.lay.cols;const p={id:newId(),t,h:1,o:Object.assign(PT[t].def(),o||{})};if(matchMedia('(max-width:760px)').matches||ws.length>=CNT_5){const c=ws.reduce((a,b)=>a.ps.length<=b.ps.length?a:b);c.ps.push({...p,h:1/c.ps.length})}else ws.push({w:CNT_100/(ws.length+1)*.9,ps:[p]});normCols();ST.lay.preset='';MON=p.id;renderWS();const x=INST.get(p.id);x&&x.el.animate([{opacity:0,transform:'scale(.98)'},{opacity:1,transform:'none'}],{duration:UI_180,easing:'ease-out'});return p}
function typeMenu(anchor,cb,cur){const main=['rank','meta','signals','kolfeed','calls','trench','newmini','smart','traders','watch','pos','ai','alerts','monitor','wallet'],wid=['kline','trades','holders'];menu(anchor,[{h:L('面板','Panels')},...main.map(k=>({t:L(PT[k].zh,PT[k].en),ic:PT[k].ic,on:k===cur,f:()=>cb(k)})),{h:L('小组件（跟着目前的币）','Widgets (follow the current token)')},...wid.map(k=>({t:L(PT[k].zh,PT[k].en),ic:PT[k].ic,on:k===cur,f:()=>cb(k)}))])}
